Several institutional mechanisms could facilitate adoption:
paper templates and reviewer forms can request target, stakeholder, purpose, scope, and validation;
benchmark documentation can label annotations as evidence, justification, or behavioral traces rather than generic explanations;
model cards can separate transparency disclosures from user-facing explanations;
shared tasks can report faithfulness, comprehensibility, and utility as separate dimensions;
